{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":691626,"ns":0,"title":"Irrationality","extract":"Irrationality is cognition, thinking, talking, or acting without rationality.\nIrrationality often has a negative connotation, as thinking and actions that are less useful or more illogical than other more rational alternatives.","description":"Thinking, talking, or acting without inclusion of rationality","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}